{"case_id": "PGBG01-059", "family": "CALCULUS", "prompt": "Differentiate f(x)=54x^3+39x^2+96x. Return Ax^2+Bx+C without spaces.", "reference": "162x^2+78x+96", "base_answer": "To differentiate the function \\( f(x) = 54x^3 + 39x^2 + 96x \\), we apply the power rule to each term:\n\n1. For the first term \\( 54x^3 \\):\n   - The derivative is \\( 54 \\cdot 3x^{3-1} = 162x^2 \\).\n\n2. For the second term \\( 39x^2 \\):\n   - The derivative is \\( 39 \\cdot 2x^{2-1} = 78x \\).\n\n3. For the third term \\( 96x \\):\n   - The derivative is \\( 96 \\cdot 1x^{1-1} = 96 \\).\n\nCombining these results, the derivative of \\( f(x) \\) is:\n\\[ f'(x) = 162x^2 + 78x + 96 \\]\n\nSo, in the form \\( Ax^2 + Bx + C \\), we have:\n\\[ A = 162, \\quad B = 78, \\quad C = 96 \\]", "pilot_answer": "162x^2+78x+96", "base_score": 0, "pilot_score": 1, "base_pass": false, "pilot_pass": true, "score_delta": 1, "classification": "WIN", "base_evaluator_reason": "string mismatch", "pilot_evaluator_reason": "string exact", "scorer_type": "normalized_string_exact", "base_metadata": {"case_id": "PGBG01-059", "family": "CALCULUS", "prompt_hash": "d715c6206d29e148f21012e8a5094f8cfde5ceee02863d8c0a6ddc8fd110e576", "score": 0, "scorer_type": "normalized_string_exact", "reason": "string mismatch", "latency_ms": 4311.303503811359, "output_token_count": 246}, "pilot_metadata": {"case_id": "PGBG01-059", "family": "CALCULUS", "prompt_hash": "d715c6206d29e148f21012e8a5094f8cfde5ceee02863d8c0a6ddc8fd110e576", "score": 1, "scorer_type": "normalized_string_exact", "reason": "string exact", "latency_ms": 405.1927742548287, "output_token_count": 14}, "case_metadata": {"blind_before_inference": true, "case_id": "PGBG01-059", "family": "CALCULUS", "generated_parameters": {"coefficients": [54, 39, 96], "generator_seed": 2026081701}, "scoring_rubric": {"type": "normalized_string_exact"}, "source_provenance": "POST_TRAINING_BLIND_GENERAL_EVAL_V0_1"}, "primary_reason": "BETTER_FORMAT_AND_CONSTRAINT_COMPLIANCE", "seco